{"title":"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For certain pairs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/a/7ca10ffe3531cf1faf6222be7eac407c47bef878.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(m,n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"51\" height=\"20\" /> of positive integers with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/9/0597f7445e43607df112da8796f2f23d43940c53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\geq n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" /> there are exactly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> distinct positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/c/b9c227e12133ee344412c05c4417e72ada95e264.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|\\log m - \\log k| &lt; \\log n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"175\" height=\"18\" />. Find the sum of all possible values of the product <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/0/150c08478d63c3d2f5cc0de4222ea9183673d7ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$mn$\" width=\"26\" height=\"8\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0dd3094ab25f06e4666ed6a71f8415b0dd6a01d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log m - \\log k = \\log \\left( \\frac mk \\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"190\" height=\"33\" />, hence we can rewrite the inequality as follows:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/e/eee7ebc6c6b6ab09faab3cc8c09cb41e1e5aa790.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[- \\log n &lt; \\log \\left( \\frac mk \\right) &lt; \\log n\\]\" width=\"206\" height=\"33\" />\nWe can now get rid of the logarithms, obtaining:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/e/cde659604a97fd807114f97691a2a64b1e971881.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac 1n &lt; \\frac mk &lt; n\\]\" width=\"91\" height=\"37\" />\nAnd this can be rewritten in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> as\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/b/e8b1fa07809e0a58f3f0806b90d502cb7dbe65aa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac mn &lt; k &lt; mn\\]\" width=\"102\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>From <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/4/4e42c309f7db7d4ccaf54aa7c42c04a1d2232e66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k&lt;mn$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" /> it follows that the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> solutions for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> must be the integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/2/872fd46c2c93ee68fecf36b068ecefc3be3e9606.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$mn-1, mn-2, \\dots, mn-50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"231\" height=\"16\" />. \nThis will happen if and only if the lower bound on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is in a suitable range -- we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/6/ea60f5a89f7ba2cd537f472e99154dd28800d68e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$mn-51 \\leq \\frac mn &lt; mn-50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"202\" height=\"33\" />.\n</p><p>Obviously there is no solution for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/9/1d96ecc15129c5631ba4a2c6578e91e3d13e3baf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />. For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/2/65262bf247c4a3c6114a8223d249dc9702619d3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"46\" height=\"15\" /> the left inequality can be rewritten as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/f/79f7bc5282d49cb767e5ba4b33b307945c4fc285.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\leq\\dfrac{51n}{n^2-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"92\" height=\"38\" />, and the right one as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/6/2b63be86a142b16eb965fc328cedba873d3d326b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m &gt; \\dfrac{50n}{n^2-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"92\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>Remember that we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/9/0597f7445e43607df112da8796f2f23d43940c53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\geq n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" />. However, for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/4/b8464ecf358a14ddaee7ad45cad8a2aed0dac7b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\geq 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" /> we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/6/546d71f2290602dc894071eddfbb477ed76c493e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{51n}{n^2-1} &lt; n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"88\" height=\"38\" />, and hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/c/3cc5d678e78938bc0ceb0fed5e5694362b69fb36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m&lt;n$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"10\" />, which is a contradiction.\nThis only leaves us with the cases <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/5/b45677614a60e6cefb63894207c667fe1718ac09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\in\\{2,3,4,5,6,7\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"148\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p>\n<ul><li>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/b/6cb7ae00764b56ee2adf59e78a1ffde9685b80db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/7/1c73840c6549bf996a5a29d8f188f315005cb43e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{100}3 &lt; m \\leq \\dfrac{102}3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"125\" height=\"37\" /> with a single integer solution <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/c/2ac82734aa3984da225e011fab8cb65c0bf89fe5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=\\dfrac{102}3=34$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"113\" height=\"37\" />.</li>\n<li>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/3/5635737307f5f0651cced8ee2e6558a426fd27b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=3$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/4/2d408d5a1bcacd216f0d271b211b962e19c1370d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{150}8 &lt; m \\leq \\dfrac{153}8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"125\" height=\"37\" /> with a single integer solution <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/d/8bdd1a16489ba9d8a70ddcafaa9faeb84b83237d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=\\dfrac{152}8=19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"113\" height=\"37\" />.</li>\n<li>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/d/47d62c89ef353efb543d3cf2d6fb304dd5b85647.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=4,5,6,7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"98\" height=\"17\" /> our inequality has no integer solutions for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />.</li></ul>\n<p>Therefore the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/5/2459b624e74db698e71f8e53c31ded6a93087a38.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$34\\cdot 2 + 19\\cdot 3 = 68 + 57 = \\boxed{125}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"249\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II\" title=\"2009 AIME II\">2009 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2009 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2009\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016235314\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.035 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 250/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1810/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 132/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6406/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.720      1 -total\n 58.86%    8.075      1 Template:AIME_box\n 39.61%    5.434      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:8046:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261016235314 and revision id 287499. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}